# --- Forward captured leads to a Google Sheet ---
# The Google Sheet sync uses the connected Replit "google-sheet" integration
# (OAuth, no Apps Script or service account required). Connect the integration
# from the Replit sidebar, then set GOOGLE_SHEET_ID to the target spreadsheet
# ID (the long token from the sheet URL: docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<ID>/...).
# The first row of "Sheet1" will be filled in automatically with column headers
# the first time a row is appended.
# GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=1IV1O73AKZrWl4Io1qVAO5zBBQD5c7UXBPfE2XU92YgU
